    "title": "Berry Factory Tycoon",
    "description": "Welcome to Berry Factory! Manage every step in your production pipeline and become World's Number One Idle Corporation!\r\n\r\nRule the Berry Fields\r\nDiligent and responsible Berrypickers and Waterspillers at your service! Improve them to harvest more berries!\r\n\r\nBuild production lines\r\nBuy and upgrade new facilities for better candy assortment! Lots of intricate devices await!\r\n\r\nRenovate your vehicles\r\nTransport cargo with trucks and loaders. Renovate and maintain them to keep jelly flow!\r\n\r\nSales management\r\nEngage in extensive advertizing to accrue new customers and make profits. Attract investors to get extra funds!\r\n\r\nExpand with brand new factories for profit growth\r\nDownload now and delve into jelly candy factory venture!",
